    "body": "(A comma in a selector is a logical OR, so yes.)\r\n\r\nHow would my selector not have the desired effect on your nested quotes scenario? If you have `<q>Something: <q>Whoa</q></q>` the selector would not apply so `quotes` would not be changed. You would need a more contrived example. (And your example even seems simpler than that, as the nested `<q>` is not a different language.)",
